From ff203efa62ded6e4c03b296e4c27501682638365 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 22:57:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 77/97] Opt-in 4096-tile EDRAM model (edram_tiles) +
 wwe13_dof_composite_nop cvar for the 1080p scene path

The 1920x1080 internal scene exceeds the 2048-tile Xenos EDRAM; edram_tiles=4096 (default 2048)
models 20 MiB. The 1080 single-pass path never resolves/binds the scene depth texture, so the DOF
composite (PS 1233F68C15FDF948) samples a stale slot 3 and blurs everything; the cvar skips that
one draw (opt-in, set only by the game at 1080).
